          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lalapho livula uphawu lwesihlanu, ngabona ngaphansi kwealtare imiphefumulo yalabo ababebulewe ngenxa yelizwi likaNkulunkulu langenxa yobufakazi ababelabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamemeza ngelizwi elikhulu besithi: Nkosi ebusayo engcwele leqotho, koze kube nini ungathonisisi uphindisele igazi lethu kulabo abakhileyo emhlabeni na? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basebenikwa, kwaba yilowo lalowo ingubo emhlophe; batshelwa ukuba baphumule okwesikhatshana, kuze kuphelele inani labayizinceku labazalwane babo ababezakubulawa njengabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.6.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
