              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ngasengibona lapho livula uphawu lwesithupha, kwaba khona ukuzamazama okukhulu komhlaba; ilanga laphenduka laba mnyama, njengelembu lokuzila, lenyanga yaba bomvu njengegazi;",
